  <header class="terms-hero"><div class="terms-kicker">STRATIC MARKET · SERVICE GUIDELINES</div><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p>Please read these terms carefully. They explain the basic rules for using Stratic Market as a customer or seller.</p></header>
