    <h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>
    <p>By accessing or using Stratic Market, you agree to use the platform lawfully, honestly and respectfully. You are responsible for the accuracy of the information you submit, including your account details, shop information, product descriptions, prices, photographs, payment details and delivery address. Sellers must have the right to offer the products they list, keep product information up to date, honour confirmed orders and communicate clearly with customers. Customers should review product details, seller information, the final price and the available payment and delivery arrangements before placing an order.</p>
    <p>Stratic Market provides tools that help buyers discover products and connect with independent sellers. Unless a specific service is expressly confirmed in the application, the platform does not guarantee product quality, stock availability, seller performance, a particular delivery date or a courier booking. A parcel request is not a confirmed shipment until the relevant delivery provider has accepted it and the applicable confirmation or tracking details have been issued. Delivery timelines, serviceability, charges and restrictions may vary by location and provider.</p>
    <p>Users must not upload unlawful, counterfeit, misleading, stolen, dangerous or prohibited products or content; misuse another person's account or personal information; interfere with the platform; attempt unauthorised access; manipulate reviews, orders or activity; or use the service for fraud, harassment or any unlawful purpose. Do not share passwords, one-time passcodes, bank PINs, payment gateway secret keys or recovery codes in product listings, chats or support messages. Each seller is responsible for securing their account and ensuring that the payment QR code or payment method attached to a product belongs to that seller.</p>
    <p><strong>Seller Activity and Delivery Support:</strong> During a seller’s first six months on Stratic Market, the seller is responsible for the delivery charges for orders placed through the platform, unless a separate written promotion states otherwise. A seller who uploads at least one genuine, available product listing on every day throughout the full six-month period may become eligible for Stratic Market’s standard delivery-cost support after that period. Eligibility must be verified by the platform, and support applies only to eligible orders, supported delivery locations and the limits or conditions communicated by Stratic Market at the time. It does not cover premium, remote-area, return, failed-delivery, reverse-pickup, storage, insurance or other special carrier charges unless expressly confirmed. Sellers must not create duplicate, misleading or unavailable listings merely to meet the daily activity requirement. Stratic Market will explain any applicable delivery-support limits before an eligible order is confirmed; no delivery subsidy is promised until eligibility and the order are confirmed.</p>
    <p>Prices, taxes, shipping charges, refunds, cancellations, returns and warranties must be communicated accurately before a transaction is completed. Where a seller and customer arrange payment or delivery directly, they are responsible for confirming the terms with each other and retaining relevant transaction records. Nothing in these terms removes any consumer right that cannot legally be excluded. Stratic Market may restrict access to content or accounts where there is a reasonable concern about fraud, security, legal compliance or a breach of these terms, and may update platform features or these terms when necessary.</p>
    <p>Your use of the platform is also subject to the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you have a question or need help with an account, listing or order, use the application's <a href="/help">Help Centre</a>. These terms should be read in accordance with the laws that apply to the user's transaction and location. If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions continue to apply to the extent permitted by law.</p>
    <div class="terms-note">Last updated: 30 October 2026. These terms are a general service notice and should be reviewed by a qualified legal professional for the locations in which Stratic Market operates.</div>
